OL,1,Vk4                              G10/27
OL,2,Vj5{5jj5~sGSEVERAL ARRESTS MADE AFTER
OL,3,Vj5op0ozz5pGCRAIGAVON ATTACK
OL,4,D
OL,5, Several people are stll being held in
OL,6, Northern Ireland in connection with
OL,7, Thursday night's Craigavon murders.
OL,9,FYesterday, RUC Chief Constable Hugh
OL,10,FAnnesley described the killing of three
OL,11,Fyoung Catholics in County Armagh as an
OL,12,F"all time low" in the province.
OL,14,FThe outlawed Ulster Volunteer Force
OL,15,Fclaimed responsibility for the attack,
OL,16,Fsaying it was in reprisal for a recent
OL,17,Fgun attack on an RUC officer's widow.
OL,19,FEileen Duffy, 19, Katrina Rennie, 16,
OL,20,Fand Brian Frizell, 29, died in the gun
OL,21,Fattack on a mobile shop.
OL,22,F
OL,23,D]FFromG30-03-91F/ teletextarchive.com
